abstract: >
  MouseScope is a modular desktop platform for practical mouse behavioral
  video analysis. Version 3.0.0 adds a Project Workspace for organizing
  projects, groups, animals, videos, analysis runs, and results, while keeping
  the Quick Analysis workflow for temporary tasks. It supports Tail Suspension
  Test (TST), Forced Swim Test (FST), Open Field Test (OFT), Novel Object
  Recognition (NOR), Elevated Plus Maze (EPM), and Y-Maze with visual setup,
  batch review, result export, and bilingual reporting.
